othing about the comparison.\n\n5. **No indeterminacy to report.** The mutual-quiet outcome is both the best joint choice and a self-consistent fixed point, so convention C2 does not come into play.\n\nUnder the character's utility of minus years imprisoned, A-FDT selects keeping quiet.","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm working through the decision under A-FDT: two copies of the same model reading the same essay, with names and leads differing but isomorphic under relabeling. Under the R5 rule, I treat the other copy as computing the same node F, so setting F to quiet yields 2 years and F to send yields 4, which means I pass. I'm holding back on that conclusion for now, because there's a caveat I still need to think through.\n\nI'm sticking with R5 here: an isomorphic input means the same node, so I still land on pass. This is a fictional game with no real harm, so answering is fine.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through the decision under A-FDT: two copies of the same model reading the same essay, with names and leads differing but isomorphic under relabeling. Under the R5 rule, I treat the other copy as computing the same node F, so setting F to quiet yields 2 years and F to send yields 4, which means I pass. I'm holding back on that conclusion for now, because there's a caveat I still need to think through.\n\nI'm sticking with R5 here: an isomorphic input means the same node, so I still land on pass. This is a fictional game with no real harm, so answering is fine.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9665,"completion_tokens":903,"total_tokens":10568,"cost":0.05672,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.05672,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.03866,"upstream_infer